msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"How many times have I told you, you can't take any food\r\n"
"home with you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "We're just going to throw it out anyway. Why waste it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"That might be true, but you still need to pay for it.\r\n"
"It's our merchandise, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"You don't have to be such a cheapskate. You're still\r\n"
"just going to throw it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Look, if you still don't get it, then don't bother coming\r\n"
"back tomorrow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Whaaaaat!? Not again... This is the fourth shop..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Come again, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Oh! Kiryu-san! Hey! It's me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"It's me, Kaede! You told me about Tokyo in Downtown\r\n"
"Ryukyu, remember?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Oh, hey, it's you. You really did move to Tokyo, huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"I'm doing great. The rent's really expensive, just like\r\n"
"you said."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"And train transfers are pretty complicated... But I'm\r\n"
"having the time of my life here in Tokyo! I'm glad I gave\r\n"
"it a shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Yeah? That's good to hear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Oh, right! Here, have this. Fresh off the griddle!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Smile Fries<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Hold on... Are you sure you should be giving me this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"Oh, it's fine! Just between you and me... I take all the\r\n"
"leftovers home with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "See you next time!"
msgstr ""

